# Cloudflare Pages — Expo Router SPA fallback.
# Every unmatched path is rewritten (status 200, not redirect) to /index.html
# so client-side routing under expo-router handles the URL (e.g.
# /coach/v2-home, /workout/abc123, /assessment). Without this, deep-link
# refreshes and pasted URLs return 404 because Cloudflare would try to
# serve a static file that doesn't exist.
/*    /index.html   200
